round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>نرخ تبدیل بالاتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>آموزش سیستماتیک</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پیگیری هوشمند</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-orange-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-6 w-6 text-orange-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">تارگتینگ پیشرفته</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">شناسایی و هدف‌گیری دقیق مخاطبان بر اساس داده‌های رفتاری.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>هدف‌گیری دقیق‌تر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بازده بالاتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بهبود ROI</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 mb-4\">چت‌بات هوشمند</div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">پاسخگویی <span class=\"gradient-text\">۲۴ ساعته و هوشمند</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">چت‌بات‌های پیشرفته با قابلیت یادگیری از مستندات شما (RAG)</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bot h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M12 8V4H8\"></path><rect width=\"16\" height=\"12\" x=\"4\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M2 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 13v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">چت‌بات RAG پیشرفته</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">پاسخگویی دقیق با یادگیری از پایگاه دانش و اسناد سازمانی شما.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>دقت بالاتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>یادگیری از داده‌ها</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پاسخ‌های مرتبط</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">ادغام با پایگاه دانش</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">اتصال مستقیم به اطلاعات محصولات و خدمات برای پاسخ‌های جامع.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>دسترسی کامل</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پاسخ‌های یکپارچه</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>به‌روزرسانی خودکار</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">گفتگوی طبیعی فارسی</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">درک عمیق زبان فارسی و قابلیت گفتگوی طبیعی و روان.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>درک بالا</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پاسخ‌های طبیعی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پشتیبانی ۲۴/۷</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 mb-4\">شخصی‌سازی محتوا</div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">تجربه <span class=\"gradient-text\">منحصربه‌فرد</span> برای هر کاربر</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">نمایش محتوا و پیشنهادات متناسب با سلیقه و رفتار هر بازدیدکننده</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">تجربه کاربری اختصاصی</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">نمایش محتوای منحصربه‌فرد برای هر کاربر بر اساس علایق.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>تجربه خاص</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>تعامل بیشتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>رضایت بالاتر</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">پیشنهاد محصول هوشمند</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">پیشنهاد محصولات مرتبط بر اساس سوابق بازدید و خرید.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>افزایش فروش</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>سبد خرید بزرگتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>کشف محصولات</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-handshake h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5 9.04 7.96a2.17 2.17 0 0 0 0 3.08c.82.82 2.13.85 3 .07l2.07-1.9a2.82 2.82 0 0 1 3.79 0l2.96 2.66\"></path><path d=\"m18 15-2-2\"></path><path d=\"m15 18-2-2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">وفادارسازی مشتری</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">ایجاد حس ارزشمندی و افزایش وفاداری با محتوای شخصی.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>وفاداری بیشتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بازگشت مکرر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ارزش طول عمر</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-purple-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">مزایای یکپارچه‌سازی <span class=\"gradient-text\">بازاریابی هوشمند</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">چرا باید تمام ابزارهای بازاریابی خود را هوشمند و یکپارچه کنید؟</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-white/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">یکپارچگی کامل تمام کانال‌های ارتباطی با مشتری</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-white/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">پاسخگویی ۲۴ ساعته بدون نیاز به نیروی انسانی اضافه</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-white/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">افزایش چشمگیر نرخ تبدیل با پیام‌های شخصی‌سازی شده</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-white/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">کاهش خطای انسانی و هزینه‌های عملیاتی</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-white/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium leading-relaxed\">جمع‌آوری و تحلیل داده‌های ارزشمند مشتریان</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-white/50 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-5 w-5 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"><